<title>CHINA: Liu Chong Hing Bank H1 net up 26.31 pct.</title>
<headline>Liu Chong Hing Bank H1 net up 26.31 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   85.0   vs 68.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    24.0   vs 18.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    341.26 vs 270.18</p>
<p>    Company name		 Liu Chong Hing Bank Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  September 8-12</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   September 19</p>
<p>NOTE - Liu Chong Hing Bank, 53.68 percent owned by Liu Chong Hing Investment Ltd, provides banking, financial and related services to commercial, industrial and individual customers.</p>
<p>Net is after the profit on disposal of investments of HK$5.29 million vs HK$3.09 million.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
